{% doc %}
  Per-fork theme identity — output ONLY.

  Echoes the fork's display name (FoxTheme Base, Motrix, …). Consumed by
  scripts.liquid for the JS console banner and any other Liquid that
  needs the theme's display name.

  This file is `merge=ours` in `.gitattributes`: child forks set their
  name once after forking and `yarn core:sync` never overwrites it.
{% enddoc -%}
{%- liquid
  echo 'FoxTheme Base'
-%}
